\b\f1 What the app does with your files\b0\f0\par
\par
AMS Sortie moves or copies the files you drop on the dial into the folders you configure. It never uploads, inspects or transmits file contents. All file handling happens locally.\par
\par
A move is performed in two verified steps: the item is copied, its size is checked, and only then is the original removed. If anything goes wrong the partial copy is deleted and the original stays where it was.\par
